[ ] Firecrawl-based `browser_navigate` and `browser_extract` tools are registered and functional, producing artifacts on screenshots.\n- [ ] `POST /api/v1/voice/transcribe` endpoint handles audio transcription via Groq Whisper and seamlessly binds to `InputPill.tsx` voice recording.\n- [ ] Fallback/mock mechanisms are active when `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY` or `GROQ_API_KEY` are unset, allowing test suites to succeed.\n- [ ] Settings connectors view includes the AES-256-GCM API Key Vault management, MCP preset gallery, and custom server registration.\n\n### Quality & Test Suite\n- [ ] Frontend type checking and build pass cleanly without errors.\n- [ ] Backend test suite (`pytest`) passes cleanly.\nEND PROMPT\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>"}
