────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  ┌────────────────────────┐  │  │ [ Draft ] a note to Boardy asking to move intro ⌝ │  │\n│  │ Calendar Events        │  │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  └────────────────────────┘  │                                                         │\n│  [ + Create a new panel ]    │  Embedded Cloud Browser Window:                         │\n│                              │  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  State B: Typographic Clock  │  │ [ Cloudflare Login Screen / Live Web View       ] │  │\n│  Tue                         │  │                                       (● Error) ⛶ │  │\n│  Nov 10                      │  │                                                   │  │\n│  6:56 PM                     │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                              │                                                         │\n│  State C: Projects List      │  Structured Action / Draft Card:                        │\n│  • FYP                       │  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  • PROJECT IDEAS             │  │ Reply to Boardy and Shubham                     ⛶ │  │\n│  • Interview Prep            │  │ To: boardy@boardy.ai   Subject: Re: Intro...      │  │\n│                              │  │ [ Full editable draft message body ]              │  │\n│                              │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n└──────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n#### 1. The Living Atmospheric Cloud Backdrop\n- **Not a flat color or synthetic gradient**: It is a dreamlike, out-of-focus photographic cloud atmosphere that simulates natural weather and sky lighting.\n  - **Light Mode Atmosphere**: Warm, soft sand, ivory cream, and blush peach cloudscape (`#EFE8DE`, `#DECFC0`, `#F7F2EA`, `#E8DDD0`).\n  - **Dark Mode Atmosphere**: Moody, dusky charcoal, smoky slate, and deep plum cloudscape (`#131217`, `#24212B`, `#1B1922`, `#2C2836`).\n- Frosted squircle surfaces (`backdrop-blur-md`) float above this living backdrop with specular glass top-rim catchlights (`inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, ...)`).\n\n#### 2. Unified Single-Page Canvas (No Traditional Navbar)\n- Traditional multi-page routing and fixed navigation bars are discarded. The app is a **single living workspace** with **floating top chrome**:\n  - **Top-Left**: Squircle Home button `[ ⌂ ]` (`44px × 44px`, `rounded-[14px]`).\n  - **Top-Center**: Floating segmented pill toggle `[ Chat | Projects ]` (`rounded-full`, height `38px`), instantly switching between conversational execution and project file management with zero page reload.\n  - **Top-Right**: Floating pill `[ Search ]` button + circular user avatar.\n\n#### 3. The 4-State Adaptive Left Column\nThe left third of the screen adapts dynamically:\n- **State A (Panels / Widgets View)**: Stack of translucent squircle cards:\n  - Weather panel (`Ojota, NG`, `27°C`, feels like 30°, sunset `5:25 PM`, `Share your location` button).\n  - Hark Usage / Plan Limit panel.\n  - Calendar panel.\n  - `+ Create a new panel` button in a pill container.\n- **State B (Typographic Clock View)**: The widgets collapse into a clean, massive editorial date and clock:\n  ```\n  Tue\n  Nov 10\n  6:56 PM\n  ```\n- **State C (Projects Index View)**: When `Projects` is active, displays `New project`, active project title (`FYP`), and nested project folders (`• PROJECT IDEAS`, `• Software Developer Interview Prep`).\n- **State D (Centralized / Focused View)**: The left column retracts completely, centering the conversational feed.\n\n#### 4. The Exact Proactivity Tag Format\nAs captured in your dark-theme screenshots, proactivity tags are **pill containers with the active verb button embedded directly on the left**:\n- `[ [Accept]  Boardy's 5:30 PM Maji invite for Thursday and...  ⌝ ]`\n- `[ [Draft]   a note asking Boardy to move your Tuesday 9 AM...  ⌝ ]`\n- Trailing corner notch `⌝` signals actionability. Tapping the verb executes immediately; tapping the text seeds the chat input.\n\n#### 5. Embedded Cloud Browser Window\n- Runs directly inside the chat feed as a rounded squircle frame.\n- Displays live page progress (e.g., Cloudflare Google Sign-In) with a floating status badge (`● Error` in red `#DC2626` or `● Active` in green) and an expand `⛶` button.\n- Assistant follow-ups and success markers (`✓ Cloudflare login saved`) render immediately beneath it.\n\n#### 6. Centered Overlay Sheets\n- **Search Overlay**: Clicking `Search` blurs the atmospheric background and surfaces a single floating pill search bar (`rounded-full`, `max-w-xl`) in the center of the viewport.\n- **Settings & Profile Sheet**: Clicking the user avatar pops a centered floating sheet with iOS/macOS-style grouped rows (`Profile`, `Scheduled tasks`, `Accounts`, `Wallet`, `System Preferences`, `Security`, etc.).\n- **Summary Document Sheet**: Centered modal with serif typography (`vensonline-backend, Oct 17 to 19`) and monospace code chips.\n\n---\n\n### Teamwork Dispatch\n\nI have sent a high-priority design directive to the active Teamwork run ([`efaba6cc-0420-4ea0-92d7-1d6ef7eda637`](conversation://efaba6cc-0420-4ea0-92d7-1d6ef7eda637)), instructing the subagents to align the component implementation, single-page living canvas, and atmospheric backdrops with these exact screenshot specifications.","thinking":"Initial analysis of the Hark Pro interface is complete, encompassing ten screenshots. Key visual elements have been identified, specifically the dynamic cloud backdrops and their color variations in both light and dark modes. Next, the user will be presented a visual and clear confirmation of this analysis.\n\n\n"}
