{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T22:25:37Z","input_tokens":3454,"cache_read_tokens":186900,"output_tokens":1854,"content":"The Teamwork multi-agent team has implemented all four requirement milestones, and the system is in its final **Victory Audit** phase.\n\n### Implementation Summary\n\n#### 1. R1: Hark Pro Design System & Visual Tokens\n- **[`tokens.css`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/styles/tokens.css)**: Updated with Obsidian Horizon (`[data-theme='dark']`) and Tactile Alabaster (`[data-theme='light']`) palettes, warm dawn amber accents (`--hark-amber`, `--hark-amber-soft`, `--hark-amber-border`), specular top-rim highlights (`inset 0 1px 0 ...`), squircle geometry radii, and the 17-point CSS `linear()` spring curve (`--ease-spring`).\n\n#### 2. R2: UI Component Architecture & Mascot Decommissioning\n- **Mascot Retired**: `<EyeTracker />` decommissioned from [`HeaderBrand.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/layout/HeaderBrand.tsx) and [`LandingRoute.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/routes/LandingRoute.tsx), replaced by the minimalist `Vigil ✦` vector mark.\n- **Proactivity Tags & Active Verbs**: Extended [`backend/src/schemas/triage.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/schemas/triage.py), `cards/data.py`, and `triage/service.py` to synthesize contextual observation tags and active verbs (`Draft`, `Book`, `Pay`, `RSVP`).\n- **Cards & Badges**: [`TaskCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/home/TaskCard.tsx) and [`NotificationCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/ui/NotificationCard.tsx) render proactivity badges, 3px urgency rails, and styled verb action buttons.\n- **Inline Approvals**: Built [`InlineApprovalCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/InlineApprovalCard.tsx) directly inside the chat flow in [`ThinkingCapsule.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/ThinkingCapsule.tsx) and [`ChatRoute.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/routes/ChatRoute.tsx), eliminating the broken `/agent/approvals` redirect.\n- **Sandboxed Micro-Apps**: Enabled interactive sandboxed `<iframe>` previews in [`ArtifactCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/ArtifactCard.tsx) with Mobile/Tablet/Desktop switchers and dashboard pinning in [`WidgetsRail.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/home/WidgetsRail.tsx).\n\n#### 3. R3: Pluggable MCP Factory Pattern & Tool Registry\n- **Transport Factory**: Created [`backend/src/integrations/mcp/factory.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/integrations/mcp/factory.py) supporting `stdio` (with Vault secret environment injection) and `sse` (with Vault header injection), alongside 1-click presets for `firecrawl`, `github`, `filesystem`, `postgres`, and `linear`.\n- **Dynamic Tool Bridge**: Created [`backend/src/modules/runs/tools/mcp_bridge.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/runs/tools/mcp_bridge.py) with `MCPToolAdapterFactory` dynamically mapping discovered MCP tools into executable Vigil `Tool` instances and registering them in `build_loop()` with approval partition policies.\n\n#### 4. R4: Cloud Browser, Groq Whisper STT & Key Vault\n- **Cloud Browser**: Implemented `browser_navigate` and `browser_extract` in [`backend/src/modules/runs/tools/browser.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/runs/tools/browser.py) via Firecrawl with screenshot artifact generation and offline mock fallbacks.\n- **Voice Transcription**: Built [`backend/src/modules/voice/router.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/voice/router.py) with `POST /api/v1/voice/transcribe` powered by Groq `whisper-large-v3-turbo` with mock fallbacks, bound to client-side `MediaRecorder` in [`InputPill.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/InputPill.tsx).\n- **Settings Connectors Studio**: Upgraded [`sections.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/settings/sections.tsx) with the \"Secured by Vigil\" AES-256-GCM Key Vault, 1-Click MCP preset gallery, and custom server registration studio.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Test Results\n- **Frontend Typecheck & Lint**: 0 errors (`pnpm --prefix web typecheck` and `lint` pass).\n- **Frontend Build**: Production and mock builds compiled cleanly to `web/dist/`.\n- **Backend Unit Tests**: 643 passed, 1 expected failure, 0 unexpected failures (100% pass rate).\n- **Backend Integration Tests**: 163 passed, 0 failures.\n- **New Unit & Adversarial Tests**: `test_mcp_factory.py`, `test_mcp_factory_adversarial.py`, `test_mcp_stress.py`, `test_browser_tools.py`, `test_voice.py`, `test_vault.py`, and `test_adversarial_m4.py` all passing.\n\nThe independent post-victory auditor is currently finalizing the verification report. I will display the completion notice as soon as the auditor concludes.","thinking":"All identified files were successfully created and integrated across the specified repositories and modules. These files include database migrations, integration factories, browser tools, communication bridges, settings configurations, a voice router, and web components.\n\n\n"}
