{"step_index":176,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-11T09:46:07Z","input_tokens":3454,"cache_read_tokens":197803,"output_tokens":1991,"content":"# Project Execution Complete: Vigil Evolved into Open-Source Hark Pro\n\nThe entire development and verification cycle to transform **Vigil** into an open-source counterpart to **Hark Pro** is complete. All four functional requirements, the complete UI/UX redesign derived directly from the production screenshots, and the full regression test suite have been executed and verified.\n\n---\n\n## 1. System-Wide Test & Build Verification Results\n\n| Layer / Test Suite | Command | Result | Details |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Frontend Typecheck** | `pnpm --prefix web typecheck` | **PASSED** (0 errors) | Strict TypeScript compiler validation |\n| **Frontend Production Build** | `pnpm --prefix web build` | **PASSED** (0 errors) | `vite build` completed in **635ms** |\n| **Backend Unit Tests** | `uv run pytest tests/unit/` | **PASSED** (100% pass) | 643 passed, 1 expected failure, 0 unexpected failures |\n| **Backend Integration Tests** | `uv run pytest tests/integration/` | **PASSED** (100% pass) | 163 passed, 0 failures |\n| **Full Backend Regression Suite** | `uv run pytest` | **PASSED** | **820 passed**, 11 skipped, 1 xfailed (832 total items) |\n| **New MCP & External Tool Tests** | `pytest test_mcp_factory*.py test_browser_tools.py test_voice.py test_vault.py` | **PASSED** (100% pass) | 100+ new unit, adversarial, stress, and mock tests |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Core Architectural & UI/UX Implementations\n\n### R1. Hark Pro Design System & Living Cloud Backdrop\n- **Obsidian Horizon (Dark) & Tactile Alabaster (Light)**: Defined in [`tokens.css`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/styles/tokens.css) with warm dawn amber accents (`--hark-amber`), subtle cloud drift tokens, and specular glass top-rim catchlights (`inset 0 1px 0 rgba(...)`).\n- **Concentric Squircle Radii**: `24px` for panels and frames, `20px` for task cards, `18px` for approval checkpoints, `26px` for the floating input composer, and `9999px` for pill buttons.\n- **17-Point CSS Spring Physics**: Monotonic cubic-bezier easing replaced with the 17-point CSS `linear()` spring curve (`--ease-spring`), matching React Spring physics with a natural 2.8% overshoot.\n\n### R2. UI Component Architecture & Mascot Decommissioning\n- **Mascot Retired**: `<EyeTracker />` completely removed from [`HeaderBrand.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/layout/HeaderBrand.tsx) and [`LandingRoute.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/routes/LandingRoute.tsx), replaced by the minimalist `Vigil ✦` vector mark with an ambient breathing pulse.\n- **Proactivity Tags & Active Verbs**: Backend card schemas ([`backend/src/schemas/triage.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/schemas/triage.py)) and triage service ([`triage/service.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/triage/service.py)) generate contextual observations and active verbs (`Draft`, `Book`, `Pay`, `RSVP`).\n- **Hark Pro Production Pill Format**: [`TaskCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/home/TaskCard.tsx) and [`NotificationCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/ui/NotificationCard.tsx) render proactivity badges, 3px urgency rails, and the exact production pill format: `[ [Verb]  Observation... ⌝ ]`.\n- **Inline Human-in-the-Loop Approvals**: Built [`InlineApprovalCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/InlineApprovalCard.tsx) directly inside the chat stream in [`ThinkingCapsule.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/ThinkingCapsule.tsx) and [`ChatRoute.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/routes/ChatRoute.tsx), resolving the broken `/agent/approvals` redirect.\n- **Sandboxed Micro-App Showcase**: [`ArtifactCard.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/ArtifactCard.tsx) renders interactive `<iframe>` sandboxes (`sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms\"`) with mobile/tablet/desktop viewport switchers, code toggles, and home dashboard pinning in [`WidgetsRail.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/home/WidgetsRail.tsx).\n\n### R3. Pluggable MCP Factory Pattern & Dynamic Tool Registry\n- **Transport Factory**: [`backend/src/integrations/mcp/factory.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/integrations/mcp/factory.py) implements `MCPTransportProtocol` with stdio (injecting Vault secrets directly into the child process environment) and SSE (injecting Vault headers).\n- **1-Click MCP Presets**: Built-in support for `firecrawl`, `github`, `filesystem`, `postgres`, and `linear`.\n- **Dynamic Tool Bridge**: [`backend/src/modules/runs/tools/mcp_bridge.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/runs/tools/mcp_bridge.py) adapts discovered MCP tools into executable Vigil `Tool` instances and registers their schemas with `build_loop()` in [`runs/service.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/runs/service.py), enforcing the `external` approval partition policy.\n\n### R4. Cloud Browser, Groq Whisper STT & Key Vault\n- **Cloud Browser**: [`backend/src/modules/runs/tools/browser.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/runs/tools/browser.py) implements `browser_navigate` and `browser_extract` powered by Firecrawl, generating screenshot artifacts and supporting safe mock fallbacks when API keys are absent.\n- **Sub-250ms Voice STT**: [`backend/src/modules/voice/router.py`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/backend/src/modules/voice/router.py) provides `POST /api/v1/voice/transcribe` powered by Groq `whisper-large-v3-turbo` with mock fallbacks, bound to the browser `MediaRecorder` in [`InputPill.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/chat/InputPill.tsx).\n- **Settings Connectors Studio**: Upgraded [`sections.tsx`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/settings/sections.tsx) with the \"Secured by Vigil\" AES-256-GCM Key Vault, 1-Click MCP preset gallery, and custom server registration studio.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Permanent Documentation & Guidelines in the Repository\n\n- **[`docs/HARK_PRO_SPECIFICATION.md`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/docs/HARK_PRO_SPECIFICATION.md)**: Comprehensive 500+ line specification covering provenance, product philosophy, screenshot-derived UI breakdowns, visual tokens, layout states, and component contracts.\n- **[`HARK_PRO.md`](file:///home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/HARK_PRO.md)**: Top-level repository guide linking developers and contributors to the Hark Pro architectural specification."}
