{"step_index":254,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-11T10:05:24Z","input_tokens":2191,"cache_read_tokens":246684,"output_tokens":1051,"thinking":"`src/components/hark/HarkLiveBrowserCard.tsx`:\n   - Remove unused variable `isFullScreen`.\n\nNo further thoughts.\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import { Maximize2 } from 'lucide-react';\n\ninterface Props {\n  title?: string;\n  to?: string;\n  subject?: string;\n  body?: string;\n  promptQuestion?: string;\n  onSend?: () => void;\n}\n\nexport function HarkEmailCard({\n  title = 'Reply to Boardy and Shubham',\n  to = 'boardy@boardy.ai, shubhammaurya2385@gmail.com',\n  subject = 'Re: Boardy Intro: Nasir + Shubham',\n  body = `Hi Boardy and Shubham,\\n\\nApologies for the late notice. I'll be at a lecture all of Tuesday morning, so I can't make the 9:00 AM intro tomorrow. Boardy, the same goes for my Pro check-in at 9:30.\\n\\nCould we move both to Thursday, October 22, any time between 1:00 and 5:00 PM Nigeria time, or to sometime next week? Shubham, sorry for the shuffle. I'm looking forward to talking.`,\n  promptQuestion = 'This replies on the Shubham thread, so he sees it too. Should I send it as written, or would you rather it go to Boardy only?',\n  onSend,\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"my-3 max-w-2xl\">\n      {/* Email Card Container */}\n      <div className=\"rounded-[22px] bg-[var(--card)] border border-[var(--border)] p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow)] backdrop-blur-xl\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[var(--border)]\">\n          <span className=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--text)]\">{title}</span>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={onSend}\n            className=\"text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)]\"\n          >\n            <Maximize2 size={13} />\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"text-[var(--text-muted)]\">To: </span>\n            <span className=\"text-[var(--text)]\">{to}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Subject: </span>\n            <span className=\"text-[var(--text)]\">{subject}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"mt-3.5 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-xl bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--text)_4%,transparent)] p-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text)]\">\n          {body}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Follow-up question & action prompt */}\n      {promptQuestion ? (\n        <div className=\"mt-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--card)] border border-[var(--border)] p-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">\n          {promptQuestion}\n        </div>\n      ) : null}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default HarkEmailCard;\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/components/hark/HarkEmailCard.tsx"}}]}
