{"step_index":748,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-11T10:52:53Z","input_tokens":2507,"cache_read_tokens":93297,"output_tokens":2711,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nSession creation and agent configuration retrieval are attempted. If either fails, an error message is set. A local ID is generated for an optimistic user message, and the last prompt is stored. The new message is optimistically added to the messages list and marked as \"sending.\" A run is then created, associated with the session and configuration, and the active run ID is updated.\n\n\nThe `send` function's error handling updates the optimistic message state to \"failed\" with network failure details if the message fails to send. The `retry` function utilizes the `send` function to resend the last prompt. Verification of the `useAgentChat` return type and the `HarkUnifiedApp.tsx` implementation is required to ensure the `send` function and session creation logic are correctly used.\n\n\nThe `chat.error` state is rendered above the input pill component in the UI. This provides immediate visual feedback to the user regarding network failures, backend issues, or missing configurations, complete with a retry button for convenience. This placement ensures errors are prominent and action-oriented. The design clearly prioritizes user experience with explicit error display and simple retry.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"/home/nasbombz/Documents/Projects/vigil-agent/web/src/queries/chat.ts","Replacement":"  const send = useCallback(\n    async (prompt: string, overrideSessionId?: string) => {\n      const trimmed = prompt.trim();\n      let target = overrideSessionId ?? sessionIdRef.current;\n      if (!trimmed) return;\n\n      if (!target) {\n        try {\n          const newSession = await api.createSession({\n            title: trimmed.slice(0, 30),\n            scope: `chat:create-session:${Date.now()}`,\n          });\n          target = newSession.session_id;\n          sessionIdRef.current = target;\n        } catch (cause) {\n          setError(userMessageOf(cause));\n          return;\n        }\n      }\n\n      let configId = defaultConfig.data?.id;\n      if (!configId) {\n        try {\n          const cfg = await api.getDefaultAgentConfig();\n          configId = cfg.id;\n        } catch (cause) {\n          setError(userMessageOf(cause));\n          return;\n        }\n      }\n\n      const localId = `local-user-${Date.now()}`;\n      optimisticIdRef.current = localId;\n      setLastPrompt(trimmed);\n      setError(null);\n      queryClient.setQueryData<StreamMessage[]>(messagesKey(target), (current) => {\n        const optimistic: StreamMessage = {\n          id: localId,\n          session_id: target!,\n          role: 'user',\n          content: trimmed,\n          created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n          local_state: 'sending',\n        };\n        return current ? [...current, optimistic] : [optimistic];\n      });\n\n      try {\n        const run = await api.createRun(\n          {\n            config_id: configId,\n            session_id: target,\n            initial_prompt: trimmed,\n          },\n          `chat:send:${target}:${Date.now()}`,\n        );\n        setActiveRunId(run.id);\n        queryClient.setQueryData(runKey(run.id), run);\n        if (optimisticIdRef.current) {\n          clearOptimisticFlag(optimisticIdRef.current);\n        }\n      } catch (cause: unknown) {\n        optimisticIdRef.current = null;\n        if (target) {\n          const reason = userMessageOf(cause);\n          queryClient.setQueryData<StreamMessage[]>(messagesKey(target), (current) =>\n            current\n              ? current.map((m) =>\n                  m.id === localId\n                    ? { ...m, local_state: 'failed', failure_class: 'network', failure_reason: reason }\n                    : m,\n                )\n              : current,\n          );\n        }\n        setError(userMessageOf(cause));\n      }\n    },\n    [defaultConfig.data, queryClient, clearOptimisticFlag],\n  );","Target":"  const send = useCallback(\n    (prompt: string) => {\n      const trimmed = prompt.trim();\n      const target = sessionIdRef.current;\n      if (!trimmed || !target) return;\n\n      const configId = defaultConfig.data?.id;\n      if (!configId) {\n        setError('The agent configuration is not ready yet. Try again in a moment.');\n        return;\n      }\n\n      const localId = `local-user-${Date.now()}`;\n      optimisticIdRef.current = localId;\n      setLastPrompt(trimmed);\n      setError(null);\n      queryClient.setQueryData<StreamMessage[]>(messagesKey(target), (current) => {\n        const optimistic: StreamMessage = {\n          id: localId,\n          session_id: target,\n          role: 'user',\n          content: trimmed,\n          created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n          local_state: 'sending',\n        };\n        return current ? [...current, optimistic] : [optimistic];\n      });\n\n      void api\n        .createRun(\n          {\n            config_id: configId,\n            session_id: target,\n            initial_prompt: trimmed,\n          },\n          `chat:send:${target}:${Date.now()}`,\n        )\n        .then((run: Run) => {\n          setActiveRunId(run.id);\n          queryClient.setQueryData(runKey(run.id), run);\n          if (optimisticIdRef.current) {\n            clearOptimisticFlag(optimisticIdRef.current);\n          }\n        })\n        .catch((cause: unknown) => {\n          optimisticIdRef.current = null;\n          if (target) {\n            const reason = userMessageOf(cause);\n            queryClient.setQueryData<StreamMessage[]>(messagesKey(target), (current) =>\n              current\n                ? current.map((m) =>\n                    m.id === localId\n                      ? { ...m, local_state: 'failed', failure_class: 'network', failure_reason: reason }\n                      : m,\n                  )\n                : current,\n            );\n          }\n          setError(userMessageOf(cause));\n        });\n    },\n    [defaultConfig.data, queryClient, clearOptimisticFlag],\n  );"}}]}
